[{"title":"商人妇","author":"谢翱","text":"抱儿来拜月，去日尔初生。\n已自满三岁，无人问五行。\n孤灯寒杵石，残梦远钟声。\n夜夜邻家女，吹箫到二更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36239,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆湖上","author":"谢翱","text":"扰扰忽半月，征衣杂市尘。\n颇疑湖上客，不是城中人。\n岸柳垂拂桨，山云泫湿巾。\n明朝在何处，相怪堕凡身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36240,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼古季清","author":"谢翱","text":"典刑前一辈，言语尚风流。\n诗律缚不住，梅花恼得愁。\n云烟今变灭，老病总宜休。\n唤醒菟裘梦，严城上雨秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36241,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜡梅","author":"谢翱","text":"冷艳清香受雪知，雨中谁把蜡为衣。\n蜜房做就花枝色，留得寒蜂宿不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36242,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别顾君际","author":"谢翱","text":"万里行可到，诗人吟到难。\n愁来时自语，写出许谁看。\n月落望如失，山空坐更寒。\n此时多少意，欲别路漫漫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36243,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后桂花引","author":"谢翱","text":"修月山人饭玉屑，瑶鸭腾腾何处热。\n吴刚生愁树合创，毫飘玉斧高枝折。\n此时待罪扣帝庭，素蛾骑蟾涕泪零。\n月中落子如雨星，至今收拾无六丁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36244,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴山谒祠","author":"谢翱","text":"吴山坊顶戴高祠，禁地凄凉江水悲。\n却是北人题记壁，迤南耆旧独无诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36245,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后湖堤步归","author":"谢翱","text":"无求如有得，散策堤边行。\n山碧眼花乱，水寒毛孔生。\n穷冬疑有雨，一雪却成晴。\n劳谢天涯月，相随步入城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36246,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其一","author":"谢翱","text":"春过江南问故家，孤根生梦半槎牙。\n到无香去飘成雪，未有叶来开尽花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36247,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其二","author":"谢翱","text":"吹老单于月一痕，江南知是几黄昏。\n水仙冷落琼花死，祇有南枝尚返魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36248,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"往姑苏与友人别杭州","author":"谢翱","text":"北关到吴会，烟草亦诗情。\n饮少但知价，行疏数问程。\n天阴月不死，江阔水能生。\n别后不得寐，相思还二更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36249,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪霁有感","author":"谢翱","text":"夜长春度梦，门雪拥笆篱。\n不倚成山积，情知有霁时。\n日高檐自雨，气上瓦如炊。\n风过梅花湿，寒香只恋枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36250,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中道士","author":"谢翱","text":"山中道士服朝霞，二十修行别故家。\n留客一杯清苦蜜，蜂房知是近梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36251,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"馀杭樵歌","author":"谢翱","text":"樵斧丁丁响翠微，赪肩半脱汗身衣。\n因来避雨岩前洞，裹得山蜂和蜜归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36252,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十年","author":"谢翱","text":"忘却寒温语，相逢一揖休。\n十年只如此，今日若为愁。\n月白夜亦昼，山寒春更秋。\n无情溪涧水，只是下滩流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36253,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜舟中遇雪","author":"谢翱","text":"岁月安有限，利名心未灰。\n雪飞今夜止，潮去隔年来。\n交友穷中见，江山尽处回。\n家人谁念道，耳热不因杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36254,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元旦舟中听潮","author":"谢翱","text":"东望拜潮水，无家在客船。\n一来仍一往，今日又今年。\n有信从天外，缘声到枕边。\n海门春树暖，吹浪起晴烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36255,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸬鹚步寻方元英故居","author":"谢翱","text":"遗像双台下，结庐烟水傍。\n子孙今几世，风雨半他乡。\n山静云眠影，叶乾虫食香。\n高名故相压，吟苦不成章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36256,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青箬亭","author":"谢翱","text":"青山何处似，疑是剡溪傍。\n采箬无人到，生莎满径荒。\n水交难辨色，花和不同香。\n归路逢樵子，麻衣草结裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36257,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题酒家壁","author":"谢翱","text":"绿阴深处问天涯，黄鸟声中见酒家。\n树上猢狲摘残果，向来才见是春花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36258,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正三立春","author":"谢翱","text":"舟中隔岁话，偪仄信谁从。\n山带去年雪，春来何处峰。\n移军增野灶，落碛减机舂。\n明日金华洞，牧羊寻故踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36259,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠山中友","author":"谢翱","text":"散策乱山云，值此山林友。\n种松高及身，扫叶落随手。\n斫尽松上枝，缚作山中帚。\n夜夜对西峰，明月生户牖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36260,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沙岸登舟","author":"谢翱","text":"五里儿女步，虚沙映断筇。\n云支半山石，帆席上溪风。\n数雁怜身只，闻鹃愿耳聋。\n市桥东半榻，侧影夕阳中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36261,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧房疥壁","author":"谢翱","text":"松树落钗股，晓行犹见灯。\n圆亭方井水，老寺少年僧。\n涧响夜疑雨，云寒春欲冰。\n山僮错相认，应道我来曾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36262,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居","author":"谢翱","text":"宿火石中取，人烟隔断霞。\n盗侵邻壤粟，女寄外翁家。\n野树刺生叶，枯松藤缠花。\n老翁头未白，相对话天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36263,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望仙都山二首 其一","author":"谢翱","text":"鼎湖只在柱峰上，地险山空不可家。\n山下人居五六月，天风吹雨碧荷花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36264,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望仙都山二首 其二","author":"谢翱","text":"道人诵经半峰下，洞里山神不敢归。\n我欲乘风到峰顶，擘翻荷叶作蓑衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36265,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叠山","author":"谢翱","text":"礧磈复崔嵬，晴云拨不开。\n钟闻上界响，石自太湖来。\n灵草捣为药，寒松烬作煤。\n欲穷登览兴，未到已徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36266,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"社前","author":"谢翱","text":"无家借燕住，离别又经年。\n客馆依山上，春分到社前。\n雨来换宿水，云起暗晴川。\n飒飒吹衣带，因风问去船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36267,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舣舟江心寺","author":"谢翱","text":"数声清磬出晴暮，落木人家散烟雾。\n风送年年江上潮，白云生根吹不去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36268,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁月","author":"谢翱","text":"岁月记不得，曾行此处村。\n日攲眠石影，树长蚀藤根。\n晚羡栖猿鸟，春来问子孙。\n劳生空可说，不是欲忘言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36269,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霅女吟","author":"谢翱","text":"罨画溪头敛翠眉，绿杨扶起又低垂。\n春风尽与花为主，不解庭前百结枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36270,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文房四友叹","author":"谢翱","text":"昆吾莫邪轻毛锥，平生故人皆引去。\n剡溪之皙绛邑黔，独与石君作一处。\n中书间起免冠谢，辄被溺冠仍嫚骂。\n见几自愧后穆生，正恐髡舂不与赦。\n有时怒发竖相如，熟视蒙恬挽其须。\n泓尤沦弃敢自爱，老龟支床息犹在。\n荆山风雨朝暮号，璞在吾怀足何罪。\n恨不雪耻酬诸姬，背水一战汉为池。\n楮生不改旧边幅，三褫何但高阁束。\n客卿骑项百折磨，犹恐玄能赤吾族。\n此时不平义重生，阳城裂麻欲死争。\n平生国士立桥下，誓死守此漆身哑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36271,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋社寄山中故人","author":"谢翱","text":"燕子来时人送客，不堪离别泪沾衣。\n如今为客秋风里，更向人家送燕归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36272,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登西台作楚歌招文丞相魂","author":"谢翱","text":"魂朝往兮何极，莫归来兮关塞黑，化为朱鸟兮有咮焉食。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36273,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续琴操哀江南 我赴蓟门四之一","author":"谢翱","text":"我赴蓟门，我心何苦。\n我本南人，我行北土。\n视彼翼轸，客星光光。\n自陪辇毂，久涉戎行。\n靡岁不战，何兵不溃。\n偷生有戚，就死无罪。\n莽莽黄沙，依依翠华。\n我皇何在，忍恤我家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36274,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续琴操哀江南 瞻彼江汉四之二","author":"谢翱","text":"瞻彼江汉，截淮及楚。\n起兵海隈，亡命无所。\n枕戈待旦，愤不顾身。\n我视王室，谁非国人。\n噫嘻昊天，使汝缧绁。\n奸党心寒，健儿胆裂。\n黄河万里，冰雪峨峨。\n尔死得死，我生谓何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36275,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续琴操哀江南 我操南音四之三","author":"谢翱","text":"我操南音，爰■我酒。\n风摧我裳，冰裂我手。\n薄送于野，曷云同归。\n自贻伊阻，不得奋飞。\n持此盈觞，化为别泪。\n昔也姬姜，今焉憔悴。\n山高水远，无相见时。\n各保玉体，将死为期。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36276,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续琴操哀江南 兴言自古四之四","author":"谢翱","text":"兴言自古，使我速老。\n麋鹿是游，姑苏荒草。\n起秣我马，裴回旧乡。\n江山不改，风景忘亡。\n谁触尘埃，不见日月。\n梨园云散，羽林鸟没。\n吞声踯躅，悲风四来。\n尔非遗民，胡独不哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36277,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春日同陈有之步至贺家湖","author":"谢翱","text":"风烟回首失，岁月但寻常。\n忠义行衰世，凄凉在异乡。\n春流荒禹迹，天泪湿句芒。\n拟剪园中韭，携篮有跛臧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36278,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄精","author":"谢翱","text":"野鹿衔花见却驯，山人采药避徭征。\n尘中剑米无炊甑，自洗黄精九曝蒸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36279,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西岩 天坛","author":"谢翱","text":"风吹软桂枝，下扫西南氛。\n坛中仙人影，冉冉化为云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36280,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西岩 天扉","author":"谢翱","text":"朝从双扉出，莫从双扉还。\n狂风吹山花，落我衣袖间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36281,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西岩 雪壁","author":"谢翱","text":"麻姑东南别，衣袂湿空翠。\n雪中米黄花，愿饷西南使。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36282,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"烟萝洞","author":"谢翱","text":"山人挂绿萝，乱后到人多。\n夜久积空翠，天深闻棹歌。\n祷龙疑井厌，看鹤值仙过。\n搔首愁纷白，无穷奈此何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36283,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄王监簿英孙","author":"谢翱","text":"天柱西南隅，开窗见雪初。\n野泉过湿竹，仙鸟下巢樗。\n草长平新堑，门閒闭旧居。\n他年宾从在，谁得入鸥书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36284,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义门曲","author":"谢翱","text":"金蓉山上云采采，白麟溪前水归海。\n溪中赤文长鲤鱼，恨无神翅谒龙威。\n广陵城头大风急，吹散游魂归未得。\n不结琼英后土祠，当充兰佩离骚国。\n富贵易夺生莫移，谁肯杀身为联枝。\n鹡鸰原上赴急难，我有冠裳可不如。\n子孙至今无裂籍，六代传来犹一日。\n白头秀才誇能文，得似君家好弟昆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36285,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄韶卿","author":"谢翱","text":"莫因梅柳忆西湖，且守仙华小隐居。\n霜木绝怜诸老尽，雨灯动是十年疏。\n休官陶令长思友，陋巷嵇康懒报书。\n衣食有馀休浪出，我愁无地可耕渔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36286,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张士达游黄山歌","author":"谢翱","text":"黄山三十六点云，中秘幽奇世人未见犹未闻。\n混沌乍开始自大唐国，易黟为黄而附轩辕鍊丹盟仙群。\n天都莲花突兀直入青云上，诸峰吐烟喷雪如波之荡漾平天矼。\n是蛟龙飞舞变幻而莫测，下有海深万丈空洞氤氲云吼浪。\n更有仙灯诸洞九龙诸潭仙桥月塔诸胜迹。\n君今策杖蜡屐走险一一当遍历，须令向禽宗炳之辈叹羡而莫及。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36287,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"谢翱","text":"谢豹花开桑叶齐，戴胜芊生药草肥，九锁山人归未归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36288,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"龙首黄扉老大臣，婆娑听履上星辰。\n西风一点违天血，同是先朝拣拔人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36289,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题唐显孝饶娥墓 其二","author":"程时登","text":"松阴庭户枕清波，小立碑亭校旧讹。\n一念纲常行宇宙，几番风雨起山河。\n世间如此丈夫少，天下从渠女妇多。\n倚遍栏干千古意，登临不敢更高歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36290,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与林止庵叶半隐分赋郡中古迹得鲁公祠右军墨池 其二","author":"艾性夫","text":"昏昏水气吐玄云，自是先生笔有神。\n不洗从来姿媚态，可怜北面卫夫人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36291,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠头陀僧","author":"艾性夫","text":"自说年深别石桥，遍游灵迹熟南朝。\n已知世路皆虚幻，不觉空门是寂寥。\n沧海附船浮浪久，碧山寻塔上云遥。\n如今竹院藏衰老，一点寒灯弟子烧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36292,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中曲 其二","author":"艾性夫","text":"深山无人风自语，古涧触石泉争鸣。\n残花时堕一两片，好鸟忽啼三五声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36293,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大明桥","author":"刘嘉谟","text":"东望扶桑路，迢迢几万程。\n沧浪将尽处，忽见大明生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36294,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"鲍寿孙","text":"少日从游今老矣，残冬话别各凄然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36295,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"篮舆一路野梅风，午酒濛濛困未松。\n侧首松梢听晴哢，数峰残雪夕阳中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36296,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禽言 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"朝看花满枝，暮见花辞树。\n东风翻覆手，骤开骤落无凭据。\n不如归去，不如归去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36297,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽赵秋晓 其二","author":"陈纪","text":"摩室兴居问亦详，祗言永诀语琅琅。\n情知竖子膏肓病，谩试庸医补泻方。\n华屋邱山真俛仰，长瓶短管付凄凉。\n平生曾赏穷吟者，莫讶衔哀入些章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36298,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义合寺二首 其一","author":"徐瑞","text":"峭壁空翠湿，幽林烟霏清。\n峰巅忽长啸，疑是孙登声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36299,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义合寺二首 其二","author":"徐瑞","text":"枯根绊老石，槁叶填古径。\n四山悄无人，铿然一声磬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36300,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寻幽","author":"徐瑞","text":"寻幽乌石谷，曳杖白云冈。\n野烧半空赤，西风万叶黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36301,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己丑正月二日入山中题岩石二首 其一","author":"徐瑞","text":"一掬岩下水，不满数寸深。\n当其伏坎时，已有东注心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36302,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己丑正月二日入山中题岩石二首 其二","author":"徐瑞","text":"我访桃源人，桃源在何处。\n世上无桃源，何必移家去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36303,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余自入山距出山五十五日竹屋青灯山阴杖屦忘其痴不了事矣随所赋录之得二十首 其一 入山","author":"徐瑞","text":"石浪啮我足，山雨湿我衣。\n冥行果为谁，笑抚桄榔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36304,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余自入山距出山五十五日竹屋青灯山阴杖屦忘其痴不了事矣随所赋录之得二十首 其二 解包","author":"徐瑞","text":"投装即虚馆，檐溜犹浪浪。\n主人眼为青，炽薪燎衣裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36305,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余自入山距出山五十五日竹屋青灯山阴杖屦忘其痴不了事矣随所赋录之得二十首 其三 看云","author":"徐瑞","text":"濛濛穿石罅，片片宿檐端。\n如示变灭相，时出复时还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36306,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余自入山距出山五十五日竹屋青灯山阴杖屦忘其痴不了事矣随所赋录之得二十首 其四 对雪","author":"徐瑞","text":"晃晃纸窗明，簌簌时闻落。\n出户欲寻诗，瘦驴双耳卓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36307,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余自入山距出山五十五日竹屋青灯山阴杖屦忘其痴不了事矣随所赋录之得二十首 其五 听雨","author":"徐瑞","text":"疏声连永夜，寒意薄吟身。\n惆怅三生梦，彭城古木春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36308,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余自入山距出山五十五日竹屋青灯山阴杖屦忘其痴不了事矣随所赋录之得二十首 其六 听泉","author":"徐瑞","text":"出山静而清，遇石何不平。\n谁能携素琴，为我写此声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":36309,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]